    "result_text": "All green. The change is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `initials` field is a computed, read-only property on the owner returned by `GET /api/owners/{id}`. I implemented it following the existing `displayName` pattern:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added an `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (read-only string), so the generated `OwnerDto` includes the field.\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` with an expression that computes the initials from the entity:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"initials\",\n       expression = \"java(Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\" + Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\")\")\n   ```\n\nFor `firstName=\"john\"`, `lastName=\"smith\"` this yields `\"J.S.\"` as specified. `Cp06Tests` passes, and all existing acceptance tests (Cp01\u2013Cp05) remain green.",
